WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.550
On every step, your coding agent resends the whole session.

2
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:09.550
That includes output that mattered once.

3
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:13.550
Gobstopper
Context compaction you can undo.

4
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:18.750
Gobstopper trims the old printouts before they reach the model.

5
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:23.350
In one recorded benchmark, it solved about as many tasks and sent fewer tokens.

6
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.890
Your session files are never edited.

7
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:34.200
Ask your agent: “Install Gobstopper from gobstopper.sh”
